{
    "title": "Gay guys chat & dating app",
    "description": "Gay dating and chat app <b>GayFriendly.dating</b> was developed with great love and attention to details. Our team has more than 10 years of experience in dating sites development and we tried to combine most important features without overloading. If you  want to connect with gay men, \r\n find other gay guys near you or trying to find love, relationship, life partner or gay soulmate - we can help you! \r\n\r\n<h1><b>Features list for gay chat dating app GayFriendly.dating</b></h1>\r\n\u2714 Instant registration and login with social networks (we do not publish anything there)\r\n\u2714 <b>Profile verification</b> in 4 steps: photo, email, social networks and phone number.  Verified profiles are marked with special badge and get priority. We recommend you to verify your account right after you install the app\r\n\u2714 Upload up to 30 photos in high resolution and change photos order\r\n\u2714 <b>Search gay people near you</b> (geo-location) with option to specify search distance\r\n\u2714 Search in one click by such important criterias as: photo, higher-education, with/without children\r\n\u2714 \"Like or Not game\" - <b>fast matching by photo</b>.  Check out photo of our gay members, click like or not - both sides will be notified in case of mutual sympathy\r\n\u2714 Filter search results to see only active gay users (those who logged in last week)\r\n\u2714 Filter search results to see only online gay users (those who are online right now)\r\n\u2714 \"Like\" other gay users to show them your sympathy\r\n\u2714 Setup in one click<b>incoming messages filter</b>, to cut off irrelevant messages\r\n\u2714 Easy to use chat resembling popular messengers with smilies. Clearly visible statuses of messages (read/unread)\r\n\u2714 Add gay users to favorite list, to find them easily later\r\n\u2714 Send welcome messages (\"pickup lines\") from list of funny and original phrases\r\n\u2714 Shiny virtual gifts you can send to attract attention and start conversation\r\n\u2714 Very detailed profiles including habits, hobbies, diet type (for vegetarians), character, pets, etc. <font color=\"red\">Matching things are marked with color</font>, so you can see what you both have in common and chat about it.\r\n\u2714 Bounce your profile to the top of search results, highlight it with animation and background color to attract more attention \r\n\u2714 Participate in exciting polls related to love and relationship and find gay partners who share your values\r\n\r\n <b>Install GayFriendly.dating right now and start browsing profiles of our gay users in a minute. Who knows, it might change your destiny!</b>\r\n\r\nGayFriendly also helps to date in clubs and parties - search nearby online users, like each other in app and approach in real life \r\n\r\nIf you have and questions/ideas/complains regarding our gay dating app, please email them to info@datesupport.net and we will answer you shortly. You can also check FAQ page on our site https://GayFriendly.dating/support and contact us there via live chat or contact form here https://GayFriendly.dating/contact\r\n\r\nOfficial website: https://GayFriendly.dating",
