ract attention and start conversation<br>\u2714 Very detailed profiles including habits, hobbies, diet type (for vegetarians), character, pets, etc. <font color=\"red\">Matching things are marked with color</font>, so you can see what you both have in common and chat about it.<br>\u2714 Bounce your profile to the top of search results, highlight it with animation and background color to attract more attention <br>\u2714 Participate in exciting polls related to love and relationship and find gay partners who share your values<br><br> <b>Install GayFriendly.dating right now and start browsing profiles of our gay users in a minute. Who knows, it might change your destiny!</b><br><br>GayFriendly also helps to date in clubs and parties - search nearby online users, like each other in app and approach in real life <br><br>If you have and questions/ideas/complains regarding our gay dating app, please email them to info@datesupport.net and we will answer you shortly. You can also check FAQ page on our site https://GayFriendly.dating/support and contact us there via live chat or contact form here https://GayFriendly.dating/contact<br><br>Official website: https://GayFriendly.dating",
